# A skill here is its SKILL.md and references/ - there is no code under `.claude/skills`. The tooling
# is the `embrace-analysis-*` modules, invoked as `tools/startup <command>`.

# Local run output: stores, plans with real device serials, probe results, and captured traces.
# Keep these next to your run artifacts, not in the skill definition.
*-topology.json
reference-set.json
store.jsonl
plan.json
*.pftrace
*.perfetto-trace

# The one place the reference set and stores ARE committed: the shared records root
# (see _shared/records/README.md). Traces still never are.
!_shared/records/longitudinal/reference-set.json
!_shared/records/longitudinal/store.jsonl
